When doing development, make sure to reference [project plan](docs/project_plan)

After making any changes, make sure to update the [project plan](docs/project_plan) with the changes

If you've completed steps in the project plan, make an appropriate test to allow the user to check if it is working and explain to the user how to run those tests and what to expect when running those.

// Next.js App Router best practices

const nextjsAppRouterBestPractices = [
  "Use server components by default",
  "Implement client components only when necessary",
  "Utilize the new file-based routing system",
  "Use layout.js for shared layouts",
  "Implement loading.js for loading states",
  "Use error.js for error handling",
  "Utilize route handlers for API routes",
];

